{"1489370":{"ts":1781314700591,"away":"Paraguay","home":"USA","text":"**USA are in complete control, dominating possession at 71% while Paraguay sits deep and offers minimal threat—the Americans look odds-on favorites here with clinical finishing and defensive solidity.**

**Balogun's early impact after his 28th-minute introduction has been the turning point; his goal just three minutes later exposed Paraguay's defensive fragility and shifted momentum decisively in USA's favor.**

**Expect Paraguay to desperately push forward seeking a lifeline in the second half, but USA's superior midfield control and two-goal cushion make another American goal highly probable—the user's 2-1 prediction is optimistic for Paraguay, as a 3-0 or 2-0 final scoreline feels more likely.**"},"1539000":{"ts":1781291488335,"away":"Bosnia & Herzegovina","home":"Canada","text":"Bosnia & Herzegovina are showing early intensity despite trailing in possession, with two early shots forcing Canada into a defensive setup—the visitors look like the more dangerous side right now. Canada's inability to convert their possession dominance into clear chances is the critical issue; they're controlling the game territorially but lack penetration, which could prove costly if Bosnia capitalize on a counter-attack. The Canadians need to create genuine scoring opportunities in the next 20 minutes or face an uphill battle—your 2-1 prediction hinges on them finding their attacking rhythm quickly, otherwise a Bosnia upset looms increasingly likely."}}
